{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-02_beg","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-02","title":"变节之刃","storyCode":"7-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c8a4b0745ce95a355cb0253fad6091cad1e44cccfa1a17af8e34ed2a14a4d79d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"narration","text":"龙门上城区 7:00 p.m. 天开始黑了"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"秘密逮捕令？陈sir？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"搞错了吧？怎么可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！回来！我问你是不是搞错了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，陈sir，怎么会......究竟是谁在搞鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"必须得找到陈sir，亲口问她才行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。我晓得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰尾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主人还有什么吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"没有了。把之前我吩咐过的事情，都处理好。做完以后就赶紧去避避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰尾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。快去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——唉。居然还有人能算倒魏彦吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，塔露拉......难道说这真是命数？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"二少爷，你要是泉下有知，也不会想看到这般光景吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了，罢了。龙门终归还是走到这步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但晖洁......晖洁！小心啊，晖洁......千万别把命送了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmenbridge"},{"type":"narration","text":"龙门停舰接舷区  7:20 p.m."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊！唔，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这个数量，真不是说说的......近卫局还没扫荡到这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天整合运动来一次，今天特殊感染者又来一次，就算是我们也顶不太住啊，又不能在城市里使用大规格武器......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，干员。他们是这次的敌人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香！哎，有救了有救了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都是被源石技艺转化的感染者......？没办法限制住他们的活动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们配备的大多是些防御装备，没想到连钢索和高纤维网都不太顶用，对上这些感染者，恐怕要上战争用军械才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"防线的压力实在太大，没办法，我们只能向本舰请求支援。幸亏来的是你，现在我们有办法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"他们体内的源石结构把他们的身体变得很坚韧，我们得用可控重火力去限制他们的行动。另外......我们检测不到他们的大脑活动的迹象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"根据观察对比，他们似乎......实质上，已经死亡了。现在的他们纯粹是被某种支配性法术驱动的。哎，太过分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"做出这种事的人......要付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你们的安全更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我制定计划吧，我来......让他们的躁动停下。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你要参与战斗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可你看起来......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士......你没见过迷迭香是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，请让一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可得小心，站远一点。这一定是你第一次见这种架势。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"放在舱门里的铁盒飞起来了？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"漂浮在空中的器械，是你的装备？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"干员，请向我描述一下目标的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"了解，我查下交流手册......嗯，目标是，呃，表征活跃的大量不安个体？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"集群活动，缺乏有效目标，趋势明显，既定路径不明。大致就这些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"——我知道了。请交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生叮嘱过，在处理结束以后，要让罗德岛本舰立刻离开龙门......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好啊，老陈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊......？你怎么在这，你的伤怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是鬼啊。那点小伤，早就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，你是在这等我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你推着的这架沙地车，是不是雷姆必拓那款最新型？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“越野，爬坡，防尘，高续航低耗能，最小的环境影响，最大的驾驶享受？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好意思。终端上看多了，一不小心就把广告词记得滚瓜烂熟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是架好车，就算我对越野不感兴趣，也想过要买一台呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"风尘仆仆的，老陈，你想往哪里去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你会知道我在这里......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你私下出城的时候都会从这里走。哪有缺口，哪有别人不知道的通道，你我都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——近卫局已经发了通缉令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那肯定。你是什么样的人，我再清楚不过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只有从这条路才能出龙门了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我躲躲藏藏了一路。如果近卫局的人都像你一样懂道理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就绝不可能出得了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他们和我一样，不希望你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊......你要拦我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么你也要拦我，星熊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然要拦你，老陈。我是龙门近卫局的督察，更是你的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是想来次千里单骑的英雄大冒险？不能放你出城的原因，也就这一个了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是龙门人，星熊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经没有其他机会了，再由魏彦吾用他的手段解决这事，只会牺牲更多人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"用你的法子就能解决了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他们叫你鬼姐，他们相信你能保护得了他们热爱的龙门。星熊，放我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，他们真的热爱龙门吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我啊，是个老套的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"漫画，电影，酒，下着雨的街道，匆匆路过的没带伞的人。除了电单车，我都喜欢老套的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"有些东西在别人看来是很容易过时的。但老陈，我们真能追得上时间吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能。我做不到。它走得太快了，它把我看重的许多东西都踩成了碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的，只有这么多。一道划痕，一个折角，一片黄斑，每一个我都能说上名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我讨厌它。我讨厌时间带走我身边的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都为了自己的一处容身之地粉身碎骨，我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着他们一个个消失，被捶打成齑粉，甚至是我动的手，他们的梦想被我亲手砸得粉碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不是爱着龙门。他们是无处容身。最后的最后，也是我让他们无处容身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能再走了，老陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你连阿发的死，连那么多为了龙门城死去的人......都可以装作没看到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"别觉得自己很懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他们处的时间比你久得多，我对他们的理解比你深得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但保护龙门是我的职责。不管谁拦在我面前，我的职责，从来没变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"还当自己是陈警司？你的职责是谁给你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......我都不知道你是不是想把这话说给自己听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看你，一个人就救得了龙门？一个人杀得了所有整合运动？耍脾气要有个限度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"挺有意思。之前是你去执行魏先生的命令，因为你能理解他。现在，变了，是我来执行魏先生的命令，只因为现在我更理解魏先生一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概猜得到魏先生的办法。既然有人要死，魏先生只会想自己去。你是陈家血脉，这件事过后，你不会受牵连。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你说他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生宁愿自己死，也不愿意你死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他想得太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能也把他想得太不是东西了，老陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他想死，那就去死好了。可他死了又能解决得了什么？能有什么用？难道战争就不会开始了？难道龙门就不会首当其冲了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他死，龙门不会被人迁怒。我想所有的责任都会随着他本人的死烟消云散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能会这么顺利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不那么顺利。所以，他要你接班近卫局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你会接他的班。近卫局局长的位子迟早是你的，下一步，你会成为这座城市的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你该去把前前后后的问题，上上下下的遗毒，全都解开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚魏先生想做的事。他一直在等一个时候，他的眼神和他的手段，从我认识他那天开始就没变过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门还需要你，龙门也不希望你冒这个险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我只感觉到一阵恶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生的死也许打动不了你，但他死后，你可以去改变这座龙门城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉你一个事实吧，星熊。一个我不属于这座城市的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"别骗我，老陈。没人比你更适合这座城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么时候......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"三年前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞒着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是故意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么连我都不能知道......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾不希望任何人知道。近卫局不能有感染者，所以我不能是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，这座城市没有感染者的容身之地。这片大地也没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经受够了魏彦吾对我们的操控。我不会再由着他去指使我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我总算......总算完完全全地明白，为什么你，老陈，为什么你不能离开龙门了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......星熊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是走了，去了核心城，魏先生就不得不把你划成敌人，你不仅是敌人，而且你必须是一个感染者，一个与龙门敌对的危险感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"整座城就都会知道你是感染者，甚至还会认为你和整合运动同谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"覆水难收，你再也回不了这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话是我该说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“你是感染者？我不在乎。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎，Missy她不在乎，九也不在乎，近卫局也不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至魏先生都不在乎。他想让你改变这里，而不是赶走你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你没看到他对感染者的无情，我看见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"至于九，她已经走了。之前她离开近卫局，是因为她也被感染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......九也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"现在想想，我和九也许是因为同个任务患上的矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她后来是我的线人，表面上加入了整合运动......然后，为了整合运动，她抛弃了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因为她看清了这座城市的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"但你根本没背叛龙门。我不会让你背上你没犯下的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，你觉得......你觉得我为什么要去核心城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"猜谜我对付不来，说明白点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道整合运动的领袖是谁吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"她的名字我记不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Missy没告诉过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉是我的姐姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。啊.......哈。我懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，你今天不可能过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么说这种话......？难道我的亲人、我的家人......都不够重要？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为这样我才不能让你过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"即使今天我要死在这里，我也不会让你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这事情不是你能决定的，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"般若决定得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——今天挡在我面前，哪怕是场天灾，我也不会乖乖束手就擒，何况是一面盾，一个鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"铸造这面盾的工匠被一群流浪的恶鬼杀了满门，他的怨气可比天灾还怨毒得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"而这面盾上沾上的鲜血、引起的惨剧......比起天灾都邪恶得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，魏先生不是个好人，我们可以合起来打他一顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什么想做的，我陪你去，什么都行。你不是喜欢我那辆哥伦比亚大缸70vv吗？我让给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，不要是现在。不要去。不要逼我。这是我最后一点点想你答应的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"逼你？你怎么说话像魏彦吾一样？......不要这么说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在魏彦吾动手的时候......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"早在他出卖自己兄弟、辜负我的母亲、让这座城市在他灰暗的罪恶里沉睡时，我就已经决定好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾怎么做，也许你觉得和你有关系，但我觉得和你没有一点关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他所做的、为你做的，和你该做的，一直是两回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生也是这么期望的。他不想做一个坏人，他渴望的不是统治......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他把剑给了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你根本就不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——理解什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不止一次，一次，一次又一次......我毁掉自己的家，毁掉自己的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"每次我都沾了一身血，每次我都打到最后，打到只剩我一个人站着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为我觉得这是对的。就因为我认定那是错的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我常常会想，我配活下来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不配。但我还是活下来了。我没法再只为自己活着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"认定对错，所以一脚踏出去......是人一生中能做的最蠢的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"后悔的味道一直就留在我的嘴里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为只有你背负了很多吗，陈大小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不要这么说话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......那为什么不能稍微理解我一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我们同甘共苦这么些年，到底有什么不能敞开说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我有苦衷，你也有，我们都清楚，可明明知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可你为什么还是不明白？我没有牵连你们任何一个人，我到底哪里没理解你们？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我见过太多死得毫无价值的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎你的身份，但我在乎你去哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会让你去。敌人的头领做到现在这步，你干什么都改变不了现状，你会白死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"让你白死，没人想看到。整个近卫局，整个龙门，没人想看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——谢谢你，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但我一定要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"当真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真要出剑，我不会怕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要过，是吗？你是不是觉得自己现在的心硬得像块铁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前就和你说过，你会沉浸在自己一个人的想法里，看不到周围的一切，看不到别人为你努力了多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一意孤行只会害了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了。只有被狠狠捶打过一遍，你才会像过去的我一样，知道自己那些可笑的执着都不过是些冲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你想打，老陈......就让我看看你比起过去两年成长了多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不 要 这 么 说 话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"EX-42 源石技艺远程操作型器械，使用者迷迭香，请批准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"允许在防卫战中运用，已批准带离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"运用人：歼灭战专员，罗德岛精英干员迷迭香，已批准开启。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那我去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛舰船的启动，麻烦你们转告可露希尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，快快，快退进舱门。别看啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是你被迷迭香战斗时迸出来的碎片打到，很可能会死喔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
